            "class": "crumb"
          },
          "html": "<a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> › <a href=\"/en/demo/\">Audio demos</a> › James & Emma"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "h1",
          "attrs": {},
          "html": "An evening for two, guided from the first touch"
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "dpitch"
          },
          "html": "Candlelit bedroom, evening wear, and a guide named Caresse. James in his suit, Emma in her elegant dress, with a feather and warm oil waiting on the nightstand. The voice sets the scene and hands out the roles. This first phase covers the opening, where attention shifts from words to gestures."
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "tag": "p",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "margin:0 0 12px;"
          },
          "html": "<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/caresse/id6758887086?l=en-US\" id=\"hero-store-cta\" class=\"hero-store-cta\" style=\"margin-top:0;\" data-store-auto data-cta-position=\"hero\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Download the app for free</a>"
